<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Jual Mesin Cuci di Ciputat — 23 Electronic</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Jual mesin cuci 1 tabung, 2 tabung, dan front loading di Ciputat. Tanya stok dan harga via WhatsApp.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div id="topbar"></div>
  <div id="header"></div>
  <div id="subnav"></div>

  <div class="crumbs">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="../index.html">Beranda</a><span class="sep">›</span>
      <a href="index.html">Produk</a><span class="sep">›</span>
      <strong>Mesin Cuci</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Jual Mesin Cuci di Ciputat</h1>
      <p>Mesin cuci 1 tabung, 2 tabung, dan front loading. Tipe, kapasitas, dan harga ditanyakan via WhatsApp karena stok berbeda per merek.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Daftar produk sedang diperbarui. Hubungi admin via WhatsApp untuk stok terbaru.</p>

          <h2 style="margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:12px;">Hal yang Sering Ditanyakan Admin</h2>
          <ul style="color:#374151;margin-left:22px;">
            <li>Kapasitas yang diinginkan (kg)</li>
            <li>Tipe: 1 tabung, 2 tabung, atau front loading</li>
            <li>Merek pilihan jika ada</li>
            <li>Area pengiriman</li>
            <li>Apakah perlu bantuan instalasi keran/air</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:12px;">Merek yang Biasa Tersedia</h2>
          <div class="brand-strip">
            <div class="brand-chip">LG</div>
            <div class="brand-chip">Sharp</div>
            <div class="brand-chip">Polytron</div>
            <div class="brand-chip">Samsung</div>
            <div class="brand-chip">Panasonic</div>
            <div class="brand-chip">Toshiba</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="aside-card">
            <h4>Tanya admin</h4>
            <p>Sebutkan jenis, kapasitas yang diinginkan, dan area pengiriman. Admin akan kirim opsi yang ready.</p>
            <a href="#" id="asideWa" class="btn btn-wa">Chat Admin Sekarang</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="cta"></div>
  <div id="footer"></div>

  <script is:inline>window.__page = { active: 'produk', basePath: '../' };</script>
  <script is:inline src="../assets/partials.js"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    document.querySelectorAll('.wa-link').forEach(a => {
      const msg = encodeURIComponent(a.dataset.msg || 'Halo 23 Electronic');
      const base = window.__waLink.split('?')[0];
      a.href = `${base}?text=${msg}`;
      a.target = '_blank'; a.rel = 'noopener';
    });
    document.getElementById('asideWa').href = window.__waLink;
    document.getElementById('asideWa').target = '_blank';
  </script>
</body>
</html>
